    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given equation is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi></math></p><p>On simplifying the equation, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>(</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>i</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now putting the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>On comparing the above equation with the general equation of the circle i.e</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>We get, centre&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p>",
